{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026WGUG1M4eET1793080167.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>水務署及路政署交代筲箕灣爆水管最新情況，路政署代表就事故向受影響市民致歉，並表示將全力配合水務署維修工作，徹查水管爆裂原因。</p><p></p><p>水務署則稱，維修水管期間，已陸續開始透過水車及水缸等提供臨時食水，目前筲箕灣及西灣河近一萬戶受影響，預計凌晨前完成修復。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:42:36.247506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T22:58:12.141953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:38:35.471511+00:00","content_hash":"5655fcffee6f6912e695fc2faebb0ccbcf7159b3514ccf8680f886779cb180a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:42:36.247506+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}